# Per CLAUDE.md Section 6: if a *.tfvars or *.env file is ever accidentally
# committed, mark it binary so git won't render its contents in diffs or
# blame views — minimizes the blast radius until the leak is noticed and
# the value is rotated.
#
# The .example versions are public contracts and must show diffs normally.

*.tfvars         binary
*.tfvars.json    binary
*.env            binary

*.tfvars.example text
secrets.example.env text
